-spacing: 0pt;\">. (</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">문의&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">054-478-7032)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;학칙 일부개정 주요내용&nbsp;</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;- 조직개편에 따른 변경사항을 반영</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;- 대학평의원회 및 교수회의 심의사항과 심의요구 권한을 명확히 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;- 주요 보직자 임명 심의 권한을 교수회에 부여</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;- 실무형 교육과정인 '마이크